64659752124", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630198_2577186362552498_3913228803140222976_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cJkJSC8qHswQ7kNvwFYSgJN&_nc_oc=Adrj8GhxLvpxfZ6Kqozcz1aeAbH18KCkydkhCyn4MNOy9QbrBuMc985ZR_n-Dw5IS_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6C7VnlvE22766oFQRK4_k7Fc6huwjO8necvbDZaAh1XA&oe=69FF1EDD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "561784124443343", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458099_2270787786557926_9182956901405556736_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-rBBrnSmf4IQ7kNvwH0AOqg&_nc_oc=AdoufsoxzOhRJJ5iq6z0xReXb3CddXgdXZUIXStNhjLxLUjt9t5-TfVfWRHkbAhcpCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5bNhKG8Ssp-t9RWS84mbE1Avgn066-mXIt7NyvUql8HQ&oe=69FF2837"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "224781318713799", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031393_523290235257100_254597187336404992_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8K3E7Tpx5C8Q7kNvwFWlnB6&_nc_oc=AdqXiOmDbxWCFvKfvuqRqCNVJwkm0eN8HHUDyC8pCh6Wg09QyVO3VM3LJmxwbXmZ4zs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7ZUWzGNlCKVEAbcvH4ksBA8WVsm3mNDkT6Cz2XdmnDwA&oe=69FF4E16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roller Coaster - Epic Bat Shooting Game", "keywords": ["Epic", "Roller", "Coaster", "Shooting", "Game"], "long_description": "Ready to experience the real adventure of Epic Roller Coaster with a new feature of bat shooting? Indulge in one of the most refined, immersive and energetic VR coasters you\u2019ve ever seen!\nIf you don\u2019t want to go for a most spooky adventure, then you can also enjoy the peaceful ride of Fantasy Roller Coaster! \nThere are 3 modes to have the fun of Epic Roller Coaster:\n1.\tSimple Peaceful Ride\n2.\tHaving Controls on Speed \n3.\tBat Shooting Mode\n\nIf you have any feedback, feel free to share. More and long